ffmpeg-dmo (@VERSION@) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Preserve the complete +stereo3d14 series, including Matroska eye shape, and its Lean Code source plan.
  * Keep carried patch authors as names only, with Origin links to the
    full upstream record; apply the same rewrite to patches inherited
    from the published source.
  * Write H.264 and HEVC frame packing during hardware encoding through
    VA-API packed headers, NVENC payloads, Vulkan units and QSV payloads.
    Enable marking by default, with explicit packing errors and opt-outs;
    AMF refuses marked input because its API has no general SEI route.
  * Represent tiled and all defined quincunx layouts in AVStereo3D and
    export them from the decoder. Preserve temporal frame identity
    independently of eye order, and clear HEVC non-packed constraints
    when the encoder writes a mark.
  * Carry upstream NVENC's HEVC SEI budget fix with its original credit;
    reserve the mandatory packing payload before optional SEI.
  * Carry the nine ORDER 174 changes and regression tests, preserving
    the AuxId and CBS mantissa implementations already present in +12.
    Append full-width reference-display fields and retain the edition's
    existing multiview representation and ffprobe output fields.

 -- Daniel Ramos (Capitain Jack) <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>  @DATE@
